# Build context: the root of decanter's repository. Podman reads this file next to the Containerfile
# (Containerfile.containerignore); with an older podman or buildah copy it to the context root as .containerignore.
# Only what the server's build reads is let through: the workspace manifest and every member's Cargo.toml (cargo
# reads them to resolve `workspace = true` of decanter-report, but builds nothing else), decanter-report's source and
# this crate. A new decanter workspace member needs its Cargo.toml listed below.
*
!Cargo.toml
!app/Cargo.toml
!crates/core/Cargo.toml
!crates/gog/Cargo.toml
!crates/ps/Cargo.toml
!crates/runtime/Cargo.toml
!crates/report
!crates/reports-server
**/.git
**/.githooks
**/.brain
**/.claude
**/target
**/keys
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/.env*
**/*.redb
**/*.passphrase
**/*access_key*
crates/reports-server/data
crates/reports-server/docs
